\par\par \b \uc2  Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  Deputy Gov: Pointless To  \highlight22\uc2 Intervene \highlight\uc2  In  Market \b0\par\par\uc2 273 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Mai 2000\par 12:44\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Deputy Governor Miranda Gultom said Monday it would be pointless for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the Indonesian rupiah either by raising interest rates or direct dollar-selling in view of the current market panic. \par \par \uc2  She predicted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-month note yield would remain flat at Wednesday's auction, despite calls for action on interest rates to defend the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . The Sertifikat Bank Indonesia note last week yielded 10.91%. \par \par \uc2  "Increasing the interest rate while the market panics is pointless," Miranda told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Non-monetary factors in Indonesia including political tension, coupled with expectations of a hike in U.S. interest rates, are driving the dollar upside, she said. \par \par \uc2  Miranda declined to forecast when the rupiah could recover from its current seven-month low. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah gained last Friday after President Abdurrahman Wahid said the government would act to boost the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , sparking speculation among dealers that the government may introduce some form of capital controls. \par \par \uc2  But Wahid ruled out this option Monday and denied that he had called for specific action, saying only that he was watching the situation closely. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials last week said they would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to support the rupiah, but dealers say they have seen little sign of this. \par \par \uc2  In any case, few participants expect Bank Indonesia can halt the rupiah's decline, which has outstripped falls in most other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The dollar ended Asian trading at IDR8,540, up from IDR8,380 late Friday. \par \par \uc2  -By Edhi Pranasidhi; 62 21 3983 1277; epranasidhi@ap.org \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5f02eh7\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
