\par\par \b \uc2  Bank  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia \highlight\uc2  says to  \highlight22\uc2 intervene \highlight\uc2  only if effective. \b0\par\par\uc2 194 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 2000\par 08:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, May 12 (Reuters) - Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market only if this would be effective in bolstering the rupiah, which has dropped to seven-month lows. \par \par \uc2  Governor Syahril Sabirin said the bank had recently been intevening in the market, but declined to give any details of the amounts involved. \par \par \uc2  "If (\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) is needed, Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will do it. If it is useful, BI will do it. If the move is considered to be useless, we will not do it," Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said he would wait for the outcome of the U.S. Federal Reserve meeting next week before deciding how the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  should guide domestic interest rates. \par \par \uc2  By 0630 GMT the rupiah was quoted at 8,545/8,575 against the dollar compard with 8,390/8,420 in late trade on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers say \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to have much of an impact on the rupiah's direction. ((Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364; Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 2000. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dw5c00kum\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
