\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Watch: Bk Indonesia Rupiah Policy Paralysis \b0\par\par\uc2  By I Made Sentana \par \uc2 1,062 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 2000\par 12:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- When Bank Indonesia obtained its independence from what it dubs "government meddling" in May last year, the main task entrusted to it was to protect the value of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's apparent fumbling this week, however, in reacting to the rupiah's slide to its lowest level in more than seven months, has highlighted the limited ammunition it has to safeguard the fragile \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the weight of the economic and political factors that make it nearly impossible for Bank Indonesia to influence the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  After falling to a low of IDR8,768 per dollar - its lowest level since Sept. 23 - the rupiah recovered towards the end of the day to around IDR8,475, down from IDR8,370 late Thursday in Asia, helped partly by rupiah-supportive comments by President Abdurrahman Wahid, but not helped at all by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , dealers say. \par \par \uc2  Part of Bank Indonesia's dilemma is that it doesn't have enough \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to fund market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . But its hands are also tied as regards using other traditional methods to boost the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , in particular its near inability to raise domestic interest rates to mitigate the impact of the upward trend in U.S. rates because of the damage this could do to the fragile economic recovery. \par \par \uc2  "There seem to be few options left for Bank Indonesia to reverse the rupiah's slide at the moment," said the treasury chief at a foreign bank in Jakarta. "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will deplete its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves easily." \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have said repeatedly over recent days that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sell dollars to boost the rupiah in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets and tighten rupiah supply in the money market, which could in turn push interest rates up. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Officials - including governor Sjahril Sabirin and senior deputy\par governor Anwar Nasution - said the nation has enough \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par reserves to allow Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  markets.\par Bk \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Reluctant To \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 \f2 \par But, dealers thinks the bank's pockets aren't deep enough to fight the\par dollar bulls.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "It's not easy for Bank Indonesia as market participants are more\par powerful," said the head of the treasury department of an Asian bank in\par Jakarta.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Indonesia's net \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves stood at $18.27 billion as\par of May 5, and its gross \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves at $29.48 billion.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Bank Indonesia is not capable of flexing strong muscle in the\par market," said a dealer with a large European bank in Jakarta. "I don't\par think it is at liberty to spend $100 million in one \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 ."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par This view was backed up by senior economics minister Kwik Kian Gie,\par who told Dow Jones Newswires in an interview that battling psychological\par factors in the market could lead swiftly to the depletion of the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's reserves, as happened in late 1997 and early 1998.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The fact there has been no sign of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  by Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par Friday - although the rupiah continued to hit fresh seven-month lows -\par was taken by the market as evidence that Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par would be purely verbal.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Backing this up - and despite comments to the contrary on Wednesday\par and Thursday - \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  governor Sjahril told journalists Friday\par that Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  will \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  only if it thinks the move will be\par effective.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Sjahril's statement was taken as proof by the market that Bank\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  recognizes that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  wouldn't be effective now, given\par the bullish trend of the dollar.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Still the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  should be prepared to act to defend the rupiah\par and should \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  "at least to tell the market that it's extremely\par unhappy with the rupiah's level," said a chief of treasury at another\par foreign bank.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The chief treasurer, like other many treasurers and dealers in\par Jakarta, declined to comment on the rupiah or on the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's\par policies on the record for this article, citing fears of intimidating\par warning calls from Bank Indonesia.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the money market meanwhile, Bank Indonesia's threat to tighten\par liquidity, also proved baseless. On Thursday and Friday, the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central\par bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  left all its money market \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rates unchanged, another\par sign that it remains reluctant to guide interest rates higher.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par On Friday, it left the overnight rate unchanged at 9.125%, the rates\par for the maturity of four and five days at 9.625% and the one-week rate\par at 9.875%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Upward Trend On U.S. Rates Imposes Tough Choice\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The market wants to see Bank Indonesia increasing interest rates to\par make the rupiah more attractive," said another dealer. "But I guess,\par they are worried that it will stifle economic growth, and will raise the\par interest payment of the government bonds."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The government has issued a whopping IDR309 trillion worth of bonds as\par of April to recapitalize 25 local banks and is expected to issue a\par further IDR100 trillion of bonds to recapitalize several state and\par private banks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The bonds carry fixed rate and floating rates tied to the average\par interest rates of Bank Indonesia's three-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia\par notes, which currently stands at 10.91%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The government calculates the cost to the budget this year of interest\par payment on the bonds of 6.5% of Gross Domestic Product this year. As\par well as increasing the pressure on Indonesia's recovering economy,\par hiking rates now would jack up this already massive bond interest bill.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par As evidence of the bank's policy paralysis, Sjahril said Friday that\par Bank Indonesia won't guide interest rates up unless the U.S. Federal\par Reserve raises rates by more than 50 basis points next week. Most\par analysts don't expect the Fed to hike by more than that level.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Rising interest rate will also boost the interest burden Bank\par Indonesia has to pay for its SBI notes. The outstanding amount SBI notes\par was IDR91.8 trillion in March.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Treasury chiefs note that the upward trend in U.S. rates imposes a\par tough choice for Indonesia and other countries in the region.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "Bank Indonesia will have to make a choice of prioritizing either the\par \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , or economic growth," one of the chief treasurers said.\par "Unfortunately it isn't an easy choice to make."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By I Made Sentana; 62 21 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1184 4253 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5c02ctw\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
