\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Kwik: Concerned About Weakness Of Rupiah \b0\par\par\uc2 581 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 Mai 2000\par 04:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - 11/05/02-32G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0232GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  - - 11/05/02-32G \par \par \uc2  0233GMT \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - 11/05/02-34G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0234GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian government is concerned about the\par weakness of the rupiah and argues that the sliding \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  doesn't\par reflect economic fundamentals, Senior Economics Minister Kwik Kian Gie\par said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In an interview with Dow Jones Newswires, Kwik also said Indonesia's\par ample \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves should be strengthening the rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The rupiah's weakness is of course a concern," he said. "Economically\par speaking, I don't understand why it is weakening."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah slid to a fresh seven-month low of 8,295 rupiah against the\par greenback Thursday, hit by strong commercial dollar demand ahead of an\par expected hike in U.S. interest rates and lingering uncertainty about\par Indonesia's commitment to economic reforms.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah is also being hammered by the surging dollar. A series of\par interest rate hikes by the U.S. Federal Reserve has made it much more\par attractive to hold greenbacks. And market participants are expecting the\par Federal Open Market Committee, the Fed's policy-making arm, to raise its\par federal funds rate by at least 25 basis points.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Many market participants expect the local \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to weaken to\par IDR8,500 to the greenback in the near term, and don't rule out a slide\par to IDR9,000, well below the rupiah's level at the beginning of the year\par of IDR7,000.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kwik argued that growing \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves - Indonesia's net\par reserves currently stand at $18.27 billion, well above the target of $14\par billion agreed to with the International Monetary Fund - as well as\par growth in exports and in the economy more broadly should lead to a much\par stronger rupiah.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "In terms of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves, in terms of growth, in terms\par of growth in exports, in terms of everything we see, the economy is\par really recovering," he said. "That's despite the fact that foreign\par investment isn't coming back yet, that so many banks are still not\par functioning, despite the fact that all conglomerates are still in (debt\par restructuring) talks with the Indonesian Bank Restructuring Agency."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kwik rejected suggestions that the economy's recovery in Indonesia is\par too fragile to be sustainable, as it is led by consumer spending, rather\par than investment and reforms.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I don't understand why a recovery which is consumer-led is fragile,"\par he said, arguing that the recovery doesn't need to be investment-led at\par this stage, given excess capacity in the country.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Kwik said the appropriate level for the rupiah - based on the\par economy's outlook - is stronger than IDR7,000, although he noted that\par uncertainty about the government is having a psychological impact.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Despite concerns about the sliding \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , Kwik said it would be\par pointless for the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 .\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I don't think the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is going to do that," he said. "We\par have experience that if things get out of hand psychologically in so\par severe a manner, that \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 forex\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  reserves can be depleted in no time."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "I'm sure that Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  knows about that and is not \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervening\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \par too much; that is the consequence of a free-float system."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank Indonesia Senior Deputy Governor Anwar Nasution said Wednesday\par the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  would \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervene\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to shore up the flagging \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , but\par traders say they haven't seen any evidence of this in Thursday trade.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By Grainne McCarthy; 62 21 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw5b02cx0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
