\par\par \b \uc2  Bk Indonesia Gov: Still Expects IDR To Move To 7,000/USD \b0\par\par\uc2 513 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 April 2000\par 04:50\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par - - 26/04/02-50G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0250GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if necessary to support the flagging rupiah, although it hasn't yet done so, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin said Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril also said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wouldn't seek to push up interest rates to boost the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Asked whether Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market, Sjahril said: "\b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Yes." \par \par \uc2  He added that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has ample \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves to do so, noting that they are at "an all-time high." \par \par \uc2  Market participants in Jakarta reckon Sjahril's comments were an effort to talk up the rupiah, with few expecting the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to actually step into the market. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rarely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, but does change dollars for rupiah in the market as required. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril said Bank Indonesia is currently changing a modest amount of between $1.0 million to $5.0 million daily on the market. He said it would continue to supply dollars to "calm the market as required." \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves as of April 20 stood at $18.19 billion, down from $18.31 billion the previous week. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah slid to a new six-month low of IDR8,070 early Wednesday, pushed down by commercial demand for dollars from Indonesian companies and political jitters in the fallout of the sacking of two ministers this week by President Abdurrahman Wahid. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rebounded somewhat midmorning Wednesday on a bout of profit-taking, but at 0434 GMT (12:34 a.m. EDT), the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was trading at IDR8,042 to the dollar, down from IDR7,935 late Tuesday. The rupiah is at its lowest level since Oct. 1. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril called the rupiah's weakness "temporary," noting that it was due to political factors. He maintained that the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could still strengthen to IDR7,000 to the dollar, the level on which the 2000 budget is based. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor said he expected interest rates to keep steady while the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is weak, nothing that if there was any move upwards or downwards in rates, it would only be a slight one. \par \par \uc2  Interest rates on short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes inched up last week to 10.92% from 10.92% previously. Bank Indonesia will auction IDR21.51 trillion of one-month notes later Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Elsewhere, Sjahril said he doesn't expect the repayment of foreign debt by some local companies to have too much of an impact on the rupiah's level. \par \par \uc2  "Bank Indonesia has already taken into account the effect of the foreign debt repayments in our exchange rate calculations," Sjahril said. \par \par \uc2  Some local companies have been buying dollars to repay offshore debt, thus boosting the level of the greenback against the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Sjahril said that with ample \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves - that are set to be buoyed further by healthy international oil prices - the rupiah could withstand the effects of the debt repayment. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 62 21 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw4q023ia\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
