\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Dn;Ctrl Bk Checks Level, Spooks  Market \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 April 2000\par 12:32\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 2000, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah closed lower against the dollar in hectic trade Wednesday, but the local unit was off a year low after Bank Indonesia checked the dollar/rupiah level in the offshore market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  After rising to a new intraday high for the year of 7,820 rupiah, the dollar ended Asian trading at IDR7,773, up from IDR7,700 late Tuesday in the offshore market. The rupiah wasn't traded in Jakarta Tuesday due to a public holiday. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market will be closed Thursday for a Muslim holiday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said state banks and offshore participants aggressively bought the dollar during the session. However, Bank Indonesia checked the dollar level against the rupiah in the Singapore market, which left the market thinking that it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers, however, said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by selling the dollar as the U.S. unit began to slide down. \par \par \uc2  "It was hectic trading Wednesday," said a dealer at a foreign bank in Jakarta. "The market disappointment with the government's lack of progress in implementing its economic reform program seems to be the only reason for the dollar rise today." \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they expect the dollar to remain well-bid in the offshore market Thursday with the absence of local banks. \par \par \uc2  Offshore participants, however, are expected to trim their long dollar positions Friday in anticipation of a Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; 62 21 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.or \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010805dw4501sau\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
