\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Down As  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Rates Cut \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Dezember 1999\par 03:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Indonesian money market rates were mostly lower early Friday as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates by 50 basis points, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  cut its overnight rate to 10% from 10.50%; slashed the rates carrying maturities between two and six days to 10.50% from 11%; and the one-week rate was moved lower to 10.75% from 11.25%. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducts a daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to manage market liquidity. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  also determines the interest rates based on liquidity conditions and on the weekly movements of the benchmark rate on its one-month SBI notes. \par \par \uc2  "It seems that Bank Indonesia is set to bring its overnight rate to pre-crisis level of 9% before the end of the year as its one-month SBI is declining ," said a dealer with a local bank. "Certainly, this is a good development for the economy. \par \par \uc2  Dealers, however, said that the impact of Bank Indonesia's rate cut on the money market rates was mitigated by an increase on liquidity demands Friday. \par \par \uc2  Liquidity demand increased as companies and banks paid need funds Thursday to pay their taxes, they said. \par \par \uc2  At 0202 GMT (9:02 p.m. EST Thursday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 10.25% and 10.75% for foreign and joint venture banks, down from between 10.75% and 10.875% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Most local banks are paying overnight rates between 10.75% and 11.00%, down from between 11% and 11.50% Thursday. \par \par \uc2  At the same time in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the dollar was trading at IDR7,090, up a bit from IDR7,070 late Thursday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; 62 21 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvch08deu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
