\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Fall; Central Bk Cut Rates \b0\par\par\uc2 307 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Dezember 1999\par 05:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- Indonesian money market rates are down early Wednesday taking a cue from Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  which lowers its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates. \par \par \uc2  At 0330 GMT (10:30 p.m. EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was at 10.75% for foreign banks down from 11% Tuesday and 11% for most local banks down from 11.25%. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said trading is quiet as most participants remain cautious in the wake of the liquidity problem at Bank Putera Multikarsa. \par \par \uc2  The bank, which is owned by the Texmaco Group, has been hit by a run on deposits since November, causing a liquidity problem. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  suspended its clearing activities Tuesday because it apparently failed to cover a negative balance with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Most dealers said Bank Putera Multikarsa has little impact on the market because of the small size of the bank, but banks are still wary of lending to small banks. \par \par \uc2  The Texmaco Group has been embroiled in a scandal wherein it allegedly obtained hefty loans from state banks through high-level political influence. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia signaled its intention to see lower rates by cutting the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates by 25 basis points. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate is now down to 11% while two-day \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate is 11.5%. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily in the money market to absorb excess liquidity. \par \par \uc2  The weekly auction of Bank Indonesia notes will likely lead to rates falling between 12.500% and 12.625%, slightly below last week's 12.860%. \par \par \uc2  The result of the auction will be known in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the dollar was trading at IDR7,210 rupiah, marginally changed from IDR7,215 traded late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 62 21 3983 1277; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvc808cj5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
