\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Rupiah Ends Lower As Local Banks Buy Dlrs \b0\par\par\uc2 254 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 November 1999\par 12:46\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA -(Dow Jones)- The Indonesian rupiah closed lower against the U.S. dollar Friday as local banks bought the dollar for year-end needs, and due to the market's increasing nervousness over the separatist movement in the country's troubled province of Aceh. \par \par \uc2  After rising to an intraday high of 7,245 rupiah, the dollar closed at IDR7,205 in Asia, up slightly from IDR7,185 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Offshore market participants were seen trimming their rupiah exposure against feared Y2K-related problems, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Market players are also getting more nervous over the Aceh crisis. The Acehnese have threatened to stage massive protests Dec. 4 in the province, on the northern tip of the island of Sumatra, to commemorate the 30th anniversary of their independence movement. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Friday they didn't see any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . In fact, statebanks, which usually sell the dollar on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , were seen buying the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  They said the replacement of Hamzah Haz as Coordinating Minister for Social Welfare and Poverty Eradication by Basri Hasanuddim didn't effect the market as the move was expected and his post isn't seen as important as other coordinating ministry portfolios such as social, politics and security, and economy. \par \par \uc2  The dollar is expected to rise Monday to test IDR7,275, with support seen at IDR7,100, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; 62 21 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dvbq086en\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
