\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia c.bank upbeat even if Habibie re-elected. \b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 Oktober 1999\par 12:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, Oct 15 (Reuters) - Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Syahril Sabirin said on Friday he expected the rupiah to strengthen to the 6,000 to 7,000 level against the dollar even if unpopular President B.J. Habibie is re-elected. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to prop the rupiah, which strengthened slightly on Friday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had come under pressure this week on concerns that mass unrest would follow if Habibie won next week's presidential vote. \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah is expected to return to a realistic range of 6,000 to 7,000," Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  "Remain optimistic," Sabirin said when asked whether the expectation could be achieved if Habibie was re-elected. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said the rupiah's slight rise on Friday was due to market psychology. \par \par \uc2  "It was because of psychological factors. BI (Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was quoted at 7,990/8,040 against the dollar by 1020 GMT compared with 8,110/8,130 in late local trade on Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Worries over Habibie's presidential re-election revived old anxieties. The rupiah plunged to an historic low of 17,000 in January 1998 when autocratic former president Suharto named Habibie as his vice-presidential candidate. \par \par \uc2  ((Jakarta newsroom +62 21 384-6364-; Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010909dvaf01utf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
