\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Money Rates Flat Midday;Rupiah Up, Confuses Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 279 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Oktober 1999\par 06:39\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates remain flat Monday midday in thin trading as market participants are uncertain which direction rates will go. \par \par \uc2  At 0414 GMT (12:14 a.m. EDT), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was at 11.75% for foreign banks, and between 12% and 12.25% for most local banks, unchanged from Friday's levels. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the rupiah's rapid strengthening Monday has confused the market, which had anticipated some upward movement for interest rates. \par \par \uc2  The market took its cue from last week's auction of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes, at which the one-month notes' average accepted rate was 13%, up from 12.97% a week earlier. \par \par \uc2  "So the market was of the view that the downward trend of interest rates is likely to stop," said a treasurer at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  However, the ascent of the rupiah Monday morning has quashed market talk of rising rates. \par \par \uc2  The market is now focusing on Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes auction, which is expected to give the market an indication of rate movement. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has maintained its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates at 11.75% for overnight funds and 12.25% for two-day funds. \par \par \uc2  The rather lackluster money market was in stark contrast with the actively trading \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah strengthened at a rapid pace to 7,605 rupiah at 0423 GMT, up from IDR7,970 late Friday, on continued expectations that an early presidential election will soon lead to political stability. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 62 21 3983 1277; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-10-99 \par \par \uc2  0439GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dva4077sn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
