\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Steady;Ctrl Bk Keeps Rate Unch \b0\par\par\uc2 229 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 September 1999\par 05:51\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly steady early Monday on ample liquidity after Bank Indonesia released 4.534 trillion rupiah (IDR) back into the system. \par \par \uc2  The fund reverses Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's previous \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market. \par \par \uc2  At 0137 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged between 11.875% and 12% for foreign banks, and between 12.25% and 12.50% for most local banks. \par \par \uc2  "There were more offers for liquidity than bids," said a a dealer at a foreign bank who said trading was subdued. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said money market rates were steady also because Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate unchanged. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept its overnight rate at 11.75%, the rates for the periods between two and four days at 12.5%, and the rate for one-week period at 12.5%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading at IDR7,875, down from IDR8,275 late Friday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Meanwhile, the swap premium for the tomorrow/next day swap fell to 8.5% from 10.5%, taking a lead from the dollar's slide in the spot market, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana;(62 21) 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 13-09-99 \par \par \uc2  0351GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9d06pbd\par }\page {\par\fs20