\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Money Rates Steady Midmorning; Liquidity Flush \b0\par\par\uc2 256 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 September 1999\par 07:06\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly steady in midmorning trading, with liquidity remaining flush ahead of Wednesday's auction of Bank Indonesia notes. \par \par \uc2  The overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged at between 11.875% and 12% for foreign banks and between 12% and 13% for local and state banks. \par \par \uc2  Interest rates on one-month Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes are expected to remain roughly steady at the auction later Wednesday and traders said the auction should be oversubscribed. \par \par \uc2  The one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  note was last week yielding 12.97%. Some dealers expect rates to go up slightly though, given the weak level of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "Domestically it's not difficult to get liquidity at the moment," said a money market trader. \par \par \uc2  Amid rising pressure from foreign governments and international lenders on the Indonesian government over the situation in East Timor, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is aiming to maintain liquidity in case of possible shocks in the market, the trader said. \par \par \uc2  Bank of Indonesia earlier Wednesday injected 3.973 trillion rupiah into the money market. \par \par \uc2  The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate is unchanged at 7.75% overnight and 12.25% for two to six days. The one-week \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate is 12.5%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, the dollar was trading at IDR8,420, up from IDR8,285 late Tuesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  -By Simon Montlake; 62 21 3983 1277; simon.montlake@dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-09-99 \par \par \uc2  0506GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv9806j56\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
