\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Flat; Ctrl Bk Rates Unchanged \b0\par\par\uc2 201 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 1999\par 05:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money-market rates were mostly flat early Thursday as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates unchanged. \par \par \uc2  At 0228 GMT (10:28 p.m. Wednesday EDT), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged between 11.85% and 12%. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia left its overnight rate at 11.75%; the rate for periods between four and six days at 12.25%; and the one-week rate at 12.50%. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a small drop in the yield on Bank Indonesia's one-month notes Wednesday, to 13.06% from 13.09%, failed to drag money-market rates lower. \par \par \uc2  Dealers noted that liquidity remained ample after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  released 5.575 trillion rupiah of funds back into the money market. \par \par \uc2  "Some banks are offering their excess liquidity but they refused to cut their rates," a dealer at a local bank said. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading at IDR7,410 rupiah, down from IDR7,525 late Wednesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana;(62-21) 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 26-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0308GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8q069ez\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
