\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Flat Despite System Failure \b0\par\par\uc2 331 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 August 1999\par 04:48\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates are stable early Tuesday on flush liquidity despite the temporary shutdown of the new real-time clearing system. \par \par \uc2  At 0218 GMT (10:18 p.m. EDT Monday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was at 11.875% for foreign banks and 12% for local banks, unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the new clearing system, which was introduced last Thursday, was down Monday and banks still haven't been informed of their balance with Bank Indonesia yet. \par \par \uc2  "We are doing it manually now," said a dealer at an American bank. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the hiccup in the new system had no impact on the interbank money market rates because banks had over-borrowed last week in anticipation of possible glitches in the system's initial implementation. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia didn't say when the new system will be up and running again. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the market still has plenty of liquidity as Bank Indonesia earlier Tuesday released IDR2.89 trillion that had been absorbed previously as part of the bank's money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  They also said the room for interbank market rates to head down is limited due to the rupiah's recent weakness against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  As such, most dealers don't expect Wednesday's auction of one-month Bank Indonesia notes to result in any significant changes in interest rate. \par \par \uc2  "Most dealers expect the rate to stay the same," said a dealer at a local bank. \par \par \uc2  The average accepted rate on the one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes last week was unchanged at 13.09%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the rupiah was quoted at IDR7,660 to the dollar, off its morning low of IDR7,775 but weaker than IDR7,525 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  kept the overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate unchanged at 11.75%. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 6221-3983-1277; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0248GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8o0674i\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
