\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia Money Rates Flat Midday; Mkt Liquidity Ample \b0\par\par\uc2 208 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 August 1999\par 07:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates are mostly flat midday Friday amid lackluster trading as the market is flush with liquidity. \par \par \uc2  At 0418 GMT (12:18 a.m. EDT), the interbank overnight rate - considered the benchmark rate - was 12%, unchanged from Thursday. \par \par \uc2  A dealer at a foreign bank said the rates remained stable despite the ample liquidity in the market because Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate was unchanged. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  daily in the market to absorb excess liquidity. \par \par \uc2  It has held its overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate steady at 11.75% since the beginning of the week. The market normally trades at 25 basis points to 50 basis points above the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rate. \par \par \uc2  "Since the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  didn't lower the rate, there's no incentive for banks to reduce their rates either," the dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The weak rupiah has also served as a reminder to banks that any rate reduction may not be sustainable. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the dollar was quoted at 7,875 rupiah, slightly weaker than IDR7,795 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 6221-3983-1277; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 13-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0503GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument