\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah -3.5% Early Afternoon;Rates, Bk Bali \b0\par\par\uc2 328 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 1999\par 09:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah is weaker in early afternoon trading Tuesday as a spate of negative factors combined to hurt sentiment on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0706 GMT (3:06 a.m. EDT), the dollar was fetching 7,295 rupiah, up 3.5% from IDR7,045 late Monday in Asia. The rupiah is now at its weakest level since June 4. \par \par \uc2  Although the rupiah has risen above its intraday low of IDR7,350, market participants said that sentiment on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  remains negative. \par \par \uc2  "At the moment we don't have anything positive to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , either from the interest rate trend, the political situation, or the Bank Bali case," said Pardi Kendi, head of treasury at PT Bank Buana. \par \par \uc2  "Everything's pointing to negative tones at moment." \par \par \uc2  Short-term interest rates have fallen to around 13.13% from around 35% at the beginning of the year and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  says they still have room to fall further. This has made holding the rupiah less attractive \par \par \uc2  On top of this, continued uncertainty surrounding who will form the next government is weighing on the rupiah as well as the alleged irregularities linked to a controversial funds transfer at Bank Bali. \par \par \uc2  The Indonesian Bank Restructuring Agency found that IDR546 billion was transferred out of Bank Bali to a company controlled by the deputy treasurer of ruling Golongan Karya party. \par \par \uc2  Market watchers say Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  via state banks to prop up the rupiah, although the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seen as "ineffective" now given that the rupiah's slide has already triggered some stop-loss options. \par \par \uc2  Local demand for dollars is also depressing the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Pardi said the next resistance level for the dollar will be IDR7,500, although he said it was unlikely it would reach that level Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 6221 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 10-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0711GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8a05xfh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
