\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -2: Rupiah Seen Hitting IDR7,500/Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 August 1999\par 11:38\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  "The dollar could go as high as IDR7,500 or IDR7,600," predicted the rupiah trader at one major U.S. bank in Singapore. "The market is still long (on) the rupiah and people are still unwinding their positions." \par \par \uc2  Dollar selling from Jakarta banks capped the dollar's rise Tuesday, however. While some traders suspected that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in an attempt to support the rupiah, others said the banks were merely selling to take profits from the dollar's run-up. \par \par \uc2  Late in Asian trading, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had retreated a touch from its earlier high to IDR7,335, up steeply from IDR7,040 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  Singapore dollar buying to unwind the other leg of the carry trade drove the Singapore dollar to a seven-month high in European and U.S. trading Monday, with the U.S. dollar being quoted as low as S$1.6635. \par \par \uc2  The Singapore dollar failed to hang on to its gains on Tuesday, however, as dealers fretted that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore might \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to check the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise. \par \par \uc2  According to one analyst, since the beginning of August the Singapore dollar has appreciated by 0.4% versus the undisclosed trade-weighted basket of \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  it is managed against. \par \par \uc2  Late in Asia the U.S. dollar was quoted against the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  at S$1.6678, up a touch from S$1.6650 the day before. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 10-08-99 \par \par \uc2  0938GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv8a05xm8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
