\par\par \b \uc2  Asian  \highlight22\uc2 Currencies \highlight\uc2  -2: Singapore Dlr Trend Depends On MAS \b0\par\par\uc2 313 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1999\par 10:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The direction taken by the Singapore dollar over the coming week depends largely on the movements of the yen and the euro against the U.S. dollar, said traders. \par \par \uc2  Although market participants are inclined to buy the Singapore \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in response to the island state's continuing economic recovery and the U.S. dollar's weakness in the major \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, they are nervous of being surprised by official \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  According to dealers, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Singapore, the de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has entered the market twice in the last week to support the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the Singapore dollar. \par \par \uc2  "If you want to know where the Singapore dollar is going next week, ask the MAS," advised one trader at a U.S. bank in the city. \par \par \uc2  Early buying pressure also pushed the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  higher against the Thai baht. \par \par \uc2  Late in Asian trading, the dollar was quoted up at THB37.1200, from THB37.0550 the day before. Dealers expect the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  to remain within its current range into the coming week, trading between THB36.90 and THB37.30. \par \par \uc2  Against the rupiah, the U.S. dollar rose to an intraday high of IDR6,915 in early trading. \par \par \uc2  Moderate dollar-selling interest later emerged, however, after Bank Indonesia's governor, Sjahril Sabirin, said that between IDR6,000 and IDR7,000 to the dollar would be an appropriate exchange rate for the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Taking that as confirmation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  to hold the U.S. dollar below IDR7,000, traders moved to sell down the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Sjahril later denied that Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market. \par \par \uc2  Late in Asian trading, the U.S. dollar was up at IDR6,835, from IDR6,820 Thursday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 30-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0854GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4250 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7u05rgu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
