\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Indonesia/ \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2 /Rupiah -2: Exchanges Dlrs In Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Juli 1999\par 10:37\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to influence the level of the rupiah, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Sjahril Sabirin said Friday. \par \par \uc2  In an interview with CNBC Asia, Sjahril also said he was satisfied with the current level of the rupiah. \par \par \uc2  "There is a possibility (the rupiah) would get stronger, but the current levels are satisfying," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dow Jones & Co. (DJ), which publishes this and other newswires, co-owns CNBC television \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asia and Europe, and provides news content to CNBC in the U.S. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah weakened late last week and earlier this week as the continued decline in domestic short-term interest rates began to render it unattractive to take positions in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Market participants say the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , acting via state banks, has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  regularly in the market all week in a bid to keep the rupiah stronger than 7,000 rupiah to the U.S. dollar. This has had some success and appears to have turned sentiment towards the rupiah around, market watchers say. \par \par \uc2  Mid-afternoon Friday, the rupiah was quoted at IDR6,835 to the dollar, up from IDR6,825 in Asia late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  rarely admits to market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although it does exchange international loan dollars for rupiah in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, which has the same effect as \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By Tom Wright; 662 266 0744; twright@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-07-99 \par \par \uc2  0837GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7u05ref\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
