\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesia/Rupiah -2: Rupiah Must Reflect Mkt Perception \b0\par\par\uc2 258 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juli 1999\par 19:17\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  PARIS (Dow Jones)-- Indonesia's senior economics minister, Ginandjar Kartasasmita, said Tuesday his government would be "comfortable" with the rupiah of around IDR6,500 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "At present with the value of IDR6,500, we are comfortable with that," the minister said. "There is room for improvement and IDR6,000 would be a good value for us." \par \par \uc2  He said such a rate for the rupiah against the dollar would help reduce inflationary pressures in the economy and help Indonesia cope with its debt burden. \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar said, however, that there would be no \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  from the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to determine the rate of \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He said the value of the rupiah had to be "a reflection of the market's perception." The minister said that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not be "workable." \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar's remarks are in line with his previous comments on the value of the rupiah, despite a weakening of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  against the dollar because of recent delays in making official the results of elections in Indonesia in June. \par \par \uc2  Ginandjar is in Paris to attend a two-day meeting of the Consultative Group of Indonesia's official bilateral and multilateral lenders, chaired by the World Bank. Earlier Tuesday Ginandjar said he expects the meeting to come up with between $5.5 billion and $6 billion to fill the gap in this fiscal year's budget. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was indicated at IDR6,980-7020 late Tuesday morning in New York. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 27-07-99 \par \par \uc2  1717GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv7r05lwq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
