\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Ends Higher On Ctrl Bk Gov Comment \b0\par\par\uc2 214 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juli 1999\par 13:05\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah ended higher against the U.S. dollar Monday after Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin "verbally \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 " to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Sjahril said a level of between 6,000 and 6,500 rupiah to the dollar remains a "good" rate for the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , although he stressed that wasn't an official \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  target. \par \par \uc2  The local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  closed Asian trading at IDR6,710 against the dollar, higher than IDR6,765 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said President B.J Habibie's statement Friday indicating that the swearing in of new legislators would be delayed to Oct. 1 from Aug. 29 weighed on the sentiment for the rupiah earlier Monday. \par \par \uc2  Habibie's statement imply the election of a new president and thus a new government will also be delayed. \par \par \uc2  However, "investors bought back the rupiah after Sjahril's comments," said a dealer with an American bank, adding the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor's words helped lift the rupiah from its lows at IDR6,830. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect the rupiah Tuesday to trade in a range of IDR6,650 to IDR6,850 against the greenback. \par \par \uc2  -By Edhi Pranasidhi; 6221 3983 1277; epranasidhi@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 05-07-99 \par \par \uc2  1105GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv75050mt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pn