\par\par \b \uc2  ASIA  \highlight22\uc2 FOREX \highlight\uc2  - Regionals barely move, await tankan. \b0\par\par\uc2 453 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Juli 1999\par 11:37\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2      0915 GMT - Regionals were narrowly mixed, with the yen \par \par \uc2  barely moved on cautiously sentiment ahead of the BOJ's \par \par \uc2  "tankan" survey due Monday. \par \par \uc2      Dollar/yen orbited around 121.00, firming slightly in \par \par \uc2  tandem with a modest rise in euro/yen. \par \par \uc2      Dealers said the the dollar's strength was capped by market \par \par \uc2  participants looking for a chance to unwind long positions \par \par \uc2  taken in anticipation of BOJ dollar-buying \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2      *** \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's chief economics minister said he would like \par \par \uc2  to see the rupiah in a range of 6,000 to 6,500 to the dollar, \par \par \uc2  but was satisfied with the current level. \par \par \uc2      Ginandjar Kartasasmita said the rupiah could hurt some \par \par \uc2  exports if it rose above 6,000, but added the level should be \par \par \uc2  looked at in a wider macroeconomic context. \par \par \uc2      If regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  rise, then the rupiah could too, he \par \par \uc2  said. \par \par \uc2      He also said the economy would return to rapid growth in \par \par \uc2  three years, and that it was already on the road to recovery. \par \par \uc2      The government had originally expected it to take five \par \par \uc2  years. \par \par \uc2      *** The Hong Kong Association of Banks said it was leaving \par \par \uc2  deposit rates unchanged at 3.50 percent. \par \par \uc2      The group's decision came after the Fed's 25 basis point \par \par \uc2  rate hike. \par \par \uc2      *** The South Korean market finished little changed against \par \par \uc2  the dollar. \par \par \uc2      The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen staying out of the market, after \par \par \uc2  recent moves to curb the won's rise. \par \par \uc2      *** The Philippine peso ended lower as domestic interest \par \par \uc2  rates are projected to drop due to newly released liquidity. \par \par \uc2      Treasury bill rates are expected to fall at the weekly \par \par \uc2  auction on Monday, following the two percentage poin cut in \par \par \uc2  bank reserve requirements, traders said. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 CURRENCIES\b0 \highlight\uc2  VS U.S. DOLLAR \par \par \uc2  Change on the day FRI 02 0931GMT \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ...Latest bid....Prev Close....Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......3.8000.........0.01% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6795.00......6820.00.........0.37% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........36.83........36.73........-0.27% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.06........37.95........-0.29% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.6974.......1.6968........-0.04% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr...32.260.......32.300.........0.12% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1164.00......1164.00.........0.00% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....121.11.......120.83........-0.23% \par \par \uc2   Change since start of Asia crisis \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .....Latest......July '97......Pct Move \par \par \uc2   Ringgit......3.7995.......2.5200........-33.68% \par \par \uc2   Rupiah......6795.00......2432.00........-64.21% \par \par \uc2   Baht..........36.83........25.90........-29.68% \par \par \uc2   Peso..........38.06........26.50........-30.37% \par \par \uc2   Sing dlr.....1.6974.......1.4300........-15.75% \par \par \uc2   Taiwan dlr..32.2600......27.7500........-13.98% \par \par \uc2   Korean won..1164.00.......842.00........-27.66% \par \par \uc2   Japan yen....121.11.......114.40.........-5.54% \par \p