\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Steady; Liquidity Stays Ample \b0\par\par\uc2 188 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juni 1999\par 03:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money-market rates were mostly stable early Thursday on ample liquidity, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0115 GMT (9:15 p.m. Wednesday EDT), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged between 18% and 18.5%. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said liquidity was ample after Bank Indonesia released 5.984 trillion rupiah into the system as the rupiah funds it absorbed in previous \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  matured. \par \par \uc2  The money-market rates haven't shown any reaction to a sharp fall in the yield of Bank Indonesia's one-month notes Wednesday, to 20.34% from 22.5%. \par \par \uc2  "We are still waiting for the announcement of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates for a guidance," a dealer at a local bank said. "If the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  cuts its rates, we will reduce our rates as well." \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at the same time, the dollar was trading at IDR6,745, slightly up from IDR6,715 late Wednesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana;(62-21) 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0135GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 4281 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6o04p40\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
