\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Flat After Peaceful Poll \b0\par\par\uc2 213 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 1999\par 05:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly flat Tuesday morning on ample liquidity after Bank Indonesia released enough liquidity into the system early. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  released 3.282 billion rupiah following the maturity of the rupiah funds it absorbed in previous money market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Dealers said that the money market welcomes Monday's peaceful elections. The elections, however, don't affect the money market rates directly. Instead, the rates widely depend on liquidity. \par \par \uc2  At 0256 GMT (10:56 p.m. Monday EDT), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged at 23.5% for foreign and joint venture banks, and 24.5% for local private banks. \par \par \uc2  "The market is pretty calm," said a dealer with a local bank. "We find no problem in getting liquidity." \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  Tuesday left its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates unchanged at 23% for overnight maturity, 24% for two-, three- and six-day periods, and 24.5% for one-week tenures. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets at the same time, the dollar was trading higher at IDR7,773, compared to IDR7,765 late Monday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0319GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6804ay0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
