\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Central bank \highlight\uc2  sees rupiah 7,500/dlr after election. \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 1999\par 08:03\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, June 4 (Reuters) - Indonesian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governor Syahril Sabirin said on Friday he saw the rupiah firming to around 7,500 against the dollar after the Monday's parliamentary election. \par \par \uc2  "I feel after the election, the rupiah will strengthen probably to around 7,500 per dollar," Sabirin told reporters. \par \par \uc2  He said the fact that the campaign had been largely peaceful so far would also help the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said he expected security would be maintained after the election. \par \par \uc2  He said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  would not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the rupiah, but he added that the bank would convert dollars in small amounts from foreign loans to buy rupiah. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said the strengthening rupiah would remain favourable for Indonesian exports. \par \par \uc2  "If the rupiah strengthened to around 7,000, we still can compete because that level is still competitive compared with other countries," he said. \par \par \uc2  Sabirin said he is optimistic that year-on-year inflation will be between 10-13 percent by end 1999, with the benchmark one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  certificate (SBI) rate falling to 17-20 percent. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The rupiah\tab   was quoted at 7,950/8,050 against the dollar at 0605 GMT, compared with 8,075/8,125 late on Thursday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Wednesday's auction of one-month SBIs resulted in a weighted average interest rate of 24.65 percent against 26.12 percent a week earlier. ((Muklis Ali, Jakarta newsroom +62 21 384-6364; Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)).\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (C) Reuters Limited 1999.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010907dv6406vqj\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
