\par\par \b \uc2  Bank Indonesia/Rupiah -3: Could Move Quickly To IDR7,500 \b0\par\par\uc2 323 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Juni 1999\par 08:09\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  "The rupiah would still be competitive at (IDR7,000 to the dollar), or even slightly lower than that maybe," Sjahril said. \par \par \uc2  He noted that Indonesia's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had lost more of its value than other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , meaning it can still appreciate while maintaining its competitive edge. \par \par \uc2  At 0536 GMT (1:36 a.m. EDT), the rupiah was quoted at IDR8,065 to the dollar. Sjahril said the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was stuck around that level now, as some doubts are lingering about how smoothly the elections will go. \par \par \uc2  He said he expects the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  could move to IDR7,500 to the dollar "quite easily," after the elections, though. The budget for fiscal year 2000, ending March 31, is based on an average rupiah/dollar level of IDR7,500. \par \par \uc2  Indonesia's election campaign winds down later Friday, bringing to an end three weeks of rallying by Indonesia's 48 political parties, which has been largely peaceful, even though the campaign has produced huge, euphoric crowds. \par \par \uc2  Many market-watchers are now betting that next week's elections leave a few parties with enough seats to form a strong coalition later this year, which in turn could lead to a rally in the rupiah, long considered a pariah \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Asia. \par \par \uc2  A rupiah that is too strong, however, could raise some problems for the government in maintaining its export competitiveness, prompting speculation that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  might have to step into the market to depress the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Sjahril said Friday, however, that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will leave the rupiah's level to market forces, saying the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . He said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  would continue to change foreign loans into rupiah on the market as required, though, which the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  doesn't consider \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  per se. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 6221 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-06-99 \par \par \uc2  0609GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv6404ah1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
