\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Flat Midday; Ample Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 28 Mai 1999\par 08:16\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates are mostly flat at midday Friday on ample liquidity despite state banks' attempts to tighten up the rates to support the weakening rupiah. \par \par \uc2  At 0530 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was unchanged at 24.5% to 25% for foreign and joint-venture banks. \par \par \uc2  Local banks were bidding slightly higher at 25% to 26%, the same as Thursday. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers said state banks were seen bidding overnight funds at 25% to 25.5%, higher than the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of 23.5%. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market everyday to absorb excess liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said they suspect that the state banks were either short of cash or trying to tighten liquidity to support the rupiah, which weakened noticeably early Friday morning. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, the rupiah touched IDR8,225 to the dollar, down from IDR8,105 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market became jittery on reports of clashes between rival political parties and expressed worry that more clashes may happen during Friday's campaign rally in which the popular Indonesian Democratic Party Of Struggle will participate. \par \par \uc2  At 0537 GMT, the rupiah was quoted at IDR8,175. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 6221-3983-1277; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 28-05-99 \par \par \uc2  0616GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5s041hb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\sh