\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Firm, Bk Indonesia Offers At 29% \b0\par\par\uc2 339 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Mai 1999\par 05:18\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were firm Wednesday morning, but are expected to soften as Bank Indonesia stepped in to offer funds and push down rates. \par \par \uc2  At 0238 GMT (10:38 p.m. EDT Tuesday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 27% and 28% for foreign and joint venture banks, flat from Tuesday. Local banks bid for overnight funds between 30% and 31%, also unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  The money market rates remained firm in the last two days despite the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move to lower \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates late last week. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market daily to absorb excess liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reversed its usual role in the market by offering overnight funds at 29%. \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  started that (Tuesday) for half an hour and the money market rates went down a bit," a dealer at a British bank said. \par \par \uc2  "This morning, BI wants to cap the rate at 29%," she said. \par \par \uc2  The firm rates were a result of foreign banks borrowing from the money market on the short-end to fund their purchase of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's one-month notes. \par \par \uc2  Such strategy proves profitable as banks are expecting interest rates to come down. Banks buying the one-month notes can lock in the high interest rates while funding such purchases through the money market where rates are falling. \par \par \uc2  Dealers expect to see another 100- to 200-basis-point fall in the auction of one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes later in the afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Last week, the one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes yielded 31.47%, lower than 33.21% a week earlier. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, the rupiah weakened to IDR7,950 to the dollar at 0244 GMT (10:44 p.m. EDT Tuesday), compared with IDR7,785 traded late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Thursday is a public holiday in Indonesia. \par \par \uc2  -By Noel Fung; 6221-3983-1277; nfung@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-05-99 \par \par \uc2  0318GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv5c03l3m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
