\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Flat On Bk Recap Deadline \b0\par\par\uc2 269 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 21 April 1999\par 05:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money-market rates were mostly flat early Wednesday on lack of trading interest, as the market awaits an announcement by the government on its bank-recapitalization program. \par \par \uc2  At 0318 GMT (11:18 p.m. Tuesday EDT), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 31% and 32% for foreign banks and financially sound joint-venture banks, unchanged from Tuesday, on ample liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Local banks obtained overnight rupiah funds at around 34%-35%, flat from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Wednesday is the deadline for the government to announce the results of its recapitalization of nine privately owned banks. \par \par \uc2  They said the government is rumored to have a list of joint-venture banks to be shut down because of their failure to obtain sufficient capital. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Although the government indicated repeatedly that April 21 was the\par deadline for recapitalization, it hasn't confirmed that there will be a\par public announcement on the subject.\par    Attention was also focused on the weekly auction of Bank Indonesia's\par notes, the results of which will be released later in the afternoon.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Dealers expect the interest rate on the one-month \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  notes\par to drop by one percentage point, to about 34.5%, continuing the downward\par trend in the rates.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Last week, the one-month note rate fell to 35.58%, from 36.4%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Bank \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Indonesia\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  left its \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervention\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  rate for overnight funds\par unchanged, at 30%.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par In the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, the dollar was trading at 8,660\par rupiah, unchanged from late Tuesday.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 21-04-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0354GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1185 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4l031bt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
