\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Stable; Mkt Flush With Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 253 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 April 1999\par 04:24\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates are flat early Friday as the system remains flush with liquidity after Bank Indonesia injected 5.363 trillion rupiah ($1=IDR8,625) into the system earlier. \par \par \uc2  The injection represented the reversal of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market which absorbs excess liquidity through borrowing from the market on maturities ranging from overnight to seven days. \par \par \uc2  At 0133 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 30% and 31% for foreign and secured joint venture banks, unchanged from Thursday. While local banks with good financial positions were bidding overnight rupiah funds between 30% and 33%; and those that will be recapitalized are bidding rupiah funds between 33% and 34%. \par \par \uc2  "Almost all banks have enough liquidity so that there weren't many bids for rupiah funds," said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  On the other hand, the banks which have excess liquidity refuse to reduce their rupiah offered rates as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate unchanged Friday. \par \par \uc2  The nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate at 30%; four-, five- and six-day rates at 32%; and one-week rate at 33%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at the same time, the dollar was trading at 8,665 rupiah (IDR), down slightly from IDR8,675 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3983 1277:imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 16-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0224GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4g02viu\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
