\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Stable Early; Liquidity Ample \b0\par\par\uc2 215 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 April 1999\par 04:54\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates are steady early Thursday as liquidity remains ample. \par \par \uc2  At 0133 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 31% and 31.5% for foreign and secured joint venture banks, unchanged from Wednesday. Local banks were bidding for overnight rupiah funds between 33% and 34%. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a further fall in the yield of Bank Indonesia's notes Wednesday to 35.58% from 36.40% hasn't affected interbank interest rates because Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  left its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates unchanged Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  set the overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate at 30%; four-, five- and six-day rates at 32%; and the one-week rate at 33%. \par \par \uc2  "I think Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is maintaining its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates to tell the market that interest rates should go lower gradually," a dealer with a local bank said. "It may reduce its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates next week." \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market early Thursday, the dollar was trading at 8,670 rupiah (IDR), little changed from IDR8,630 late Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia injected IDR6.175 trillion into the money market early Thursday. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 3983 1277; imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 15-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0254GMT \par \par \uc2  1