\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Unch Midmorning; Ample Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 282 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 April 1999\par 07:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates remain unchanged midmorning Wednesday, with liquidity in the market remaining ample. \par \par \uc2  At 0424 GMT (12:24 a.m. EDT), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 31%-32% for local banks with sound financial positions, and between 30-31% for foreign banks. Both remained unchanged from Tuesday, but still lower than last week. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said the continuing lower rates were a result of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's lower overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate as well as expectations that interest rates on one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes will fall again at the weekly auction later. Last week one-month rates fell over 100 basis points to 36.42%. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's was offering to absorb excess liquidity from the market at at an \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of 30%, unchanged from early Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  It will seek to absorb 18 trillion rupiah at its weekly Wednesday \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  paper auction of one-month and three-month paper. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, the dollar was fetching 8,675 rupiah, compared with IDR8,690 late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  "We're expecting another cut in interest rates today," said a dealer at a foreign bank, despite comments by the International Monetary Fund warning Indonesia not to "prematurely" ease monetary policy. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, Bank Indonesia, injected 4.244 trillion rupiah into the money market. \par \par \uc2  The injection represented the reversal of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market, which absorbs excess liquidity through borrowing from the market on maturities ranging from overnight to seven days. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 6221 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 14-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0557GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4e02sti\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
