\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Dn; SBI Rates Seen Falling More \b0\par\par\uc2 312 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 April 1999\par 06:20\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were lower mid-morning Tuesday with liquidity remaining ample, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0120 GMT (9:20 p.m. EDT Monday), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 30.25%-30.75%, for foreign and secured joint-venture banks down from 31%-32% Monday, while rates for local banks with a sound financial position were around 31% and 34%, slightly lower than Monday. \par \par \uc2  Market participants said the lower rates were a result of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's lower overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate as well as expectations that interest rates on one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes will fall again at the weekly auction Wednesday. Last week one-month rates fell over 100 basis points to 36.42%. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia was offering to absorb excess liquidity from the market at 30%, unchanged from early Monday, although dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was offering 29% Monday afternoon. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said talk of a large student protest later in the day wasn't affecting the money market although it was causing some jitters in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \uc2  The dollar mid-morning was fetching 8,737 rupiah (IDR), roughly unchanged from IDR8,730 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  "The money market's still the same, still pretty liquid," said a treasury dealer with a foreign bank. "There are some protests in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets where many players don't want to open new rupiah positions, but the money market is calm." \par \par \uc2  Earlier, Bank Indonesia injected IDR3.936 trillion into the money market. The injection represented the reversal of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market which absorbs excess liquidity through borrowing from the market on maturities ranging from overnight to seven days. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 6221 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 13-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0420GMT \par \par \uc2  1185 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4d02p92\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
