\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Ends Flat On Mixed Trading Interest \b0\par\par\uc2 289 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 April 1999\par 11:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Lacking fresh market-moving leads, the Indonesian rupiah (IDR) ended Monday flat on mixed trading interest and tight range. \par \par \uc2  At Asia's close, the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted at IDR8,730 to the dollar, a touch lower than the IDR8,717 traded late Friday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said domestic dollar buying by a major British bank was countered by dollar supply from offshore banks in Singapore. \par \par \uc2  The state-owned banks were also seen offering and selling dollars at IDR8,740-IDR8,760 level but some state banks were dollar buyers. \par \par \uc2  Mixed trading interest resulted in the rupiah traded within the range of IDR8675 to IDR8760. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said major players remained sidelined, especially some banks in Hong Kong which were short dollars. \par \par \uc2  "They prefer to wait until the dollar goes down before buying back," said a dealer at an American bank. \par \par \uc2  However, dealers reckoned that the US dollar will find support at IDR8,500. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah stayed stable despite Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move to lower its overnight \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate to 29% from 30% Monday. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  everyday in the money market to absorb excess liquidity and the level of interest rates offered is indicative of the trend. \par \par \uc2  "(Bank Indonesia) is under serious pressure from the real sector to lower rates," said a dealer at an American bank. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah has shown relative resilience against the country's political troubles in East Timor which has been re-ignited recently on talks of independence. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par So, dealers expect the rupiah to trade within a tight range of\par IDR8,680 to IDR8,710.\par    -By Noel Fung; 6221-3983-1277; nfung@ap.org\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 12-04-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0952GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4c02r3t\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
