\par\par \b \uc2  Bk Indonesia/Gov -3: Ensures Supply Of Dlr  \highlight22\uc2 Forex \highlight\uc2  To Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 183 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 April 1999\par 09:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market participants say Indonesian state banks have been helping to maintain the rupiah's current level by quasi-market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  At 0728 GMT, the rupiah is trading at IDR8,775 to a U.S. dollar, or unchanged from late Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Indonesian state-owned banks usually sell dollars on behalf of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which rarely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly in the market. \par \par \uc2  What Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  does is "to provide some confidence that dollar-\b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  is (available)," Sjahril said. He contrasted this with the first half of 1998 when dollar liquidity was tight. \par \par \uc2  He said the amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  changed in the market by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  isn't significant and doesn't happen everyday. \par \par \uc2  "We try to do it in accordance with market needs," the central banker added. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia officials have said a welcome side-effect of the dollar-selling is that it creates stability in the rupiah-exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 6221 3983 1277; grainne.mccarthy@cor.dowjones.com \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 07-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0753GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4702kzg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
