\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Flat Mid-Morning; State Bks Seen In Mkt \b0\par\par\uc2 242 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 April 1999\par 05:35\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah managed to hold its ground against the dollar early Monday despite the surge of the greenback against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , helped largely by the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by state-owned banks, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  At 0323 GMT, the dollar was quoted at IDR8,653, hardly changed from IDR8,650 late Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Indonesian markets were closed Friday for a public holiday. \par \par \uc2  "The dollar's firmer against regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but for the time being, state banks are still offering (to sell dollars) at IDR8,870-8,800," said a dealer at a foreign bank. \par \par \uc2  This is viewed by the market as quasi \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  rarely, if ever, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market directly, but does so via state banks. \par \par \uc2  The action of offering to sell dollars at a certain level keeps market participants on the sidelines with many reluctant to take long dollar positions. \par \par \uc2  "At the moment, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can consider this as successful," said the dealer. He added that he doubted the state bank action would be able to insulate the rupiah over the longer term however. \par \par \uc2  "If there's any other negative political news, the rupiah will weaken pretty quickly," he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is seen trading in an IDR8,600-8,800 range Monday. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 6221 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 05-04-99 \par \par \uc2  0335GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv4502ke4\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
