\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Rupiah Ends Higher After State Bank Dlr-Selling \b0\par\par\uc2 354 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 12:57\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--The Indonesian rupiah closed higher in unusually active trading Tuesday as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  allegedly \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  via bank intermediaries in both offshore and domestic markets ahead the end of the fiscal year end. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah, however, gave up some of its gains in the afternoon session as local customers rushed to buy dollars, taking advantage of the sharp fall in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  After jumping as high as 8,450 (IDR) to the dollar, the rupiah ended at IDR8,725 in the spot market in Asia, stronger from IDR8,850 late Monday. \par \par \uc2  "Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was likely tied up to a fiscal-year end window dressing," said a dealer with a local bank, noting that the dollar-selling took the market by surprise given that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wasn't seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  indirectly in the market at the end of the calendar year. \par \par \uc2  There will be no trading Wednesday for fiscal-year book closing. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  acted via state banks and foreign banks. The bank rarely, if ever, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  directly. \par \par \uc2  Although dealers said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  ultimately failed to move the rupiah significantly, it mitigated the possible negative impact of a rating cut by Standard & Poor's Corp. Earlier Tuesday, the ratings agency cut Indonesia's long-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  credit rating to "selective default" from triple-C-plus. \par \par \uc2  Some dealers expect Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  Thursday, marking the beginning of the new fiscal year, to bring the rupiah nearer to the bank's target of IDR7,500 to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  "If the rupiah continues to strengthen, the government will have more room to let interest rates fall," a dealer with a foreign bank said. \par \par \uc2  The average interest rate of Bank Indonesia's one-month note fell to 37.42% at the weekly auction Tuesday, marking the third consecutive weekly fall. \par \par \uc2  Other dealers, however, said Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's limited \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves limits its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  capacity. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 3983 1277;imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 30-03-99 \par \par \uc2  1057GMT \par \par \uc2  1159 1848 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3u02fbz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
