\par\par \b \uc2  Rupiah strengthens ahead of fiscal year-end. \b0\par\par\uc2 228 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 12:50\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, March 30 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah strengthened on Tuesday, with the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  seen \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the market to prop up the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead of fiscal year-end on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah ended at 8,740/8,750 against the dollar compared with 8,845/8,855 at the close of local trading on Monday. \par \par \uc2  "Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is likely to have agressively \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  into the market by selling dollars through Singapore, Hong Kong and Australian banks to prop up the rupiah ahead of fiscal year-end," one foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The dealer said the move was expected to partly help corporates book improved first quarter financial results. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said news that Standard & Poor's on Tuesday lowered its long-term foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  sovereign credit rating on the Republic of Indonesia failed to weaken the rupiah, they said. \par \par \uc2  "The rating cut had largely been expected. It's not surprising," another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said a slight fall in the key \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  certificates (SBIs) auction rates on Wednesday had largely been expected. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia's weekly auction of one-month SBI certificates resulted in a weighted average interest rate of 37.42 percent against 37.48 percent last week. ((Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364; Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1999. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010908dv3u05jwg\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
