\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Mkt Rates Stable Early On Ample Liquidity \b0\par\par\uc2 231 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 03:21\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly steady early Wednesday as liquidity is ample in the market and banks are having no problem accessing funds. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia injected 4.197 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the money market earlier in the day. The injection came from the maturity of rupiah Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  absorbed during previous \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , with maturities ranging from one to seven days. \par \par \uc2  At 0148 GMT (8:48 p.m. Tuesday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 33% and 34% for foreign and secured joint venture banks and between 34% and 35% for local banks. \par \par \uc2  Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  is launching another \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market to absorb excess liquidity. It's offering an overnight rate at 33%, higher than its regular \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate at 30%. \par \par \uc2  Later in the day, the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  will hold auction of its one-month notes to absorb IDR12 trillion. \par \par \uc2  The note yield was 37.60% last week, down from 37.64% previously. \par \par \uc2  "We can easily get the same yield again," said a dealer with a local bank. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, the dollar was trading at IDR8,830, down from IDR8,910 late Tuesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana; (62-21) 3983 1277;imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 24-03-99 \par \par \