\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Flat Ahead Of SBI Auction \b0\par\par\uc2 290 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 04:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money-market interest rates were mostly unchanged Wednesday, with ample liquidity in the market ahead of the auction of one-month \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  notes later. \par \par \uc2  At around 0319 GMT (10:19 p.m. Tuesday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 33% and 34% for foreign and large joint-venture banks, and between 34% and 35% for better-quality local banks, both largely unchanged from Monday. \par \par \uc2  Dealers doubt Bank Indonesia will be able to guide interest rates lower at the auction of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia notes later in the session, despite comments by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  Governor Sjahril Sabirin Tuesday indicating the bank would like to. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia will seek to absorb 12.5 trillion rupiah (IDR) ($1=IDR8,900) at its weekly Wednesday \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  paper auction. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia last week auctioned IDR9.983 trillion one-month SBI notes, at a weighted average interest rate of 37.64%. \par \par \uc2  The fact that the rupiah appears to have reversed its upward trend however, limits the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's options, said a treasury chief at a Jakarta bank. \par \par \uc2  "We don't expect much change in rates, considering the exchange rate hasn't recovered yet," he said. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, the dollar was fetching IDR8,950, up from IDR8,855 late Tuesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, Bank Indonesia injected IDR4.422 trillion into the money market. \par \par \uc2  The injection represents the reversal of Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market, which absorbs excess liquidity through borrowing from the market in maturities ranging from overnight to seven days. \par \par \uc2  -By Grainne McCarthy; 6221 3983 1277; gmccarthy@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0359GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3h022nf\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
