\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian rupiah stable, testing 9,000. \b0\par\par\uc2 248 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 04:27\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1999 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  JAKARTA, March 8 (Reuters) - The Indonesian rupiah was stable in early trade on Monday and was testing the 9,000 mark amid worries over weekend violence in the eastern island of Ambon, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The rupiah was quoted at 8,900/8,920 against the dollar by 0220 GMT compared with 8,900/8,930 in late trading on Friday. \par \par \uc2  "The market has been testing the 9,000 mark for about a week. But the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , through state banks, has so far been able to keep the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  mostly at the current levels," one foreign bank dealer said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , placed rupiah \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rates on five tenors early on Monday. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  paid 30 percent for one-day, 33 percent for two, three and four-day money and 34 percent for seven-day money. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was seen as an effort to help tighten liquidity which would was expected to prevent the rupiah from breaking through 9,000, another dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers, however, said rupiah liquidity remained largely sufficient for big banks. Bank Indonesia supplied some 3.5 trillion rupiah temporarily to the money market early on Monday. \par \par \uc2  More than 200 people have died in and around Ambon in two months in communal fighting between Christian Ambonese and Moslem migrants from elsewhere in the vast archipelago. ((Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364; Fax +6221 344-8404, jakarta.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) 