\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Up As Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 237 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 04:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money market rates were mostly higher in cautious dealings early Monday as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia intervenes\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the money market to absorb liquidity. \par \par \uc2  Besides the daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is borrowing rupiah from banks at a 33% overnight rate, higher than the rate of its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of 30%. \par \par \uc2  "Banks increased their lending rates for other banks as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  continues the extra \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," a dealer with a local bank said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers, however, expect rates to go lower if Bank Indonesia is out of the market later in the day. \par \par \uc2  At 0240 GMT, the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 33% and 34% for foreign and joint venture banks, up from between 31% and 32% late Friday; for large local banks the rate was between 34% and 35%, up from 33% and 34%. Whereas, ailing banks continued bidding for overnight rupiah between 40% and 60%. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at the same time, the dollar was trading at 8,900 rupiah (IDR), unchanged from late Friday in Asia. \par \par \uc2  Earlier Bank Indonesia injected IDR3.517 trillion into the money market. \par \par \uc2  The injection came from the maturity of rupiah Bank Indonesia absorbed from the market in previous money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3983 1277:imsentana@ap.org \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 08-03-99 \par \par \uc2  0303GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3801sy2\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
