\par\par \b \uc2  Indonesian Money Market Rates Up; Bk  \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia Intervenes \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 1999\par 03:40\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1999, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  JAKARTA (Dow Jones)--Indonesian money-market rates were mostly higher early Thursday as Bank \b \highlight22\uc2 Indonesia\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  by offering a higher overnight interest rate than the rate at its daily money-market \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The nation's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was offering an overnight rate of 33%, higher than its daily \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate of 30%. \par \par \uc2  At 0142 GMT (8:42 p.m. Wednesday EST), the overnight interbank rate - considered the benchmark rate - was between 33.5% and 34% for foreign joint-venture and state-owned banks, up slightly from 31% and 32% late Wednesday. Meanwhile, most local banks were bidding for the overnight rupiah between 35% and 36%, up from between 34% and 35% earlier. \par \par \uc2  "We don't want to lend our rupiah to other banks at a rate lower than Bank Indonesia's rate," said a dealer at a joint-venture bank. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia stepped up its move to absorb liquidity from the market after it increased last week because of salary payments. \par \par \uc2  Bank Indonesia injected a net 3.667 trillion rupiah (IDR) into the money market early Thursday. \par \par \uc2  The expiration of Sertifikat Bank Indonesia (SBI), Bank Indonesia's short-term notes, added IDR15.667 trillion to the system. However, the settlement of new SBIs drained IDR12 trillion from the system. \par \par \uc2  In a weekly auction Wednesday, the one-month SBI yielded an average rate of 32.42%, up from 32.32% a week earlier. \par \par \uc2  In the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market at 0142 GMT, the dollar was trading at IDR8,925, up from IDR8,870 late Wednesday in Asia. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par -By I Made Sentana (62-21) 3983 1277;imsentana@ap.org\par -0-    04/03/99 02-40G\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) Dow Jones Newswires 04-03-99\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0240GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010826dv3401pok\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (indonesia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl